(180,	1,	'2026-07-16 09:56:25',	'2026-07-16 09:56:25',	'<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://chards.wasmer.app/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/bg2-768x770-1.png\",\"id\":123,\"hasParallax\":true,\"dimRatio\":50,\"customOverlayColor\":\"#3d3b52\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":false,\"minHeight\":2071,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"contentPosition\":\"top center\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-parallax has-custom-content-position is-position-top-center\" style=\"min-height:2071px\"><div class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-123 size-full has-parallax\" style=\"background-position:50% 50%;background-image:url(https://chards.wasmer.app/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/bg2-768x770-1.png)\"></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#3d3b52\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"http://chards.wasmer.app/index.php\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"chards.wasmer.app/index.php\">&lt;&lt;Back</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"73px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:73px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://chards.wasmer.app/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/nf-1024x1024.png\",\"id\":177,\"dimRatio\":0,\"minHeight\":458,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"contentPosition\":\"top center\",\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":[]}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover aligncenter has-custom-content-position is-position-top-center\" style=\"min-height:458px\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-177\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://chards.wasmer.app/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/nf-1024x1024.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-0 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\">Welcome To</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">The world was forever changed when crystal-like meteorites fell from the sky aeons ago. During the cataclysmic event known as The Nightfall, these mysterious crystal fragments scattered across one half of the planet. The crystals became known as Fragmenta.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Along with them came a strange new form of energy unlike anything the world had ever seen. Humanity named this energy Aenephsy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"38px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Noctis Fragmenta is a collectible card game where players open card packs and build collection albums featuring characters, locations, items, and events from the world of Noctis Fragmenta.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">While opening packs, players also have a chance to discover Story Cards. These special cards unlock comic-book-style chapters that become available for everyone to read. Finding a Story Card is no small feat—it is an exceptionally rare event, and those who uncover one are forever immortalized within the story itself.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"45px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:45px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">But that\'s only the beginning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Players can also acquire their own Fragmenta—a custom NFC card linked directly to the game. Owning a Fragmenta provides several benefits, including:<br>-  Instantly opening the game by simply scanning your Fragmenta, taking you directly to the pack-opening screen.<br>-  Unlocking the ability to discover Story Cards.<br>-  Reducing the cooldown between pack openings.<br>-  Receiving additional bonuses if your Fragmenta has been empowered by Aenephsy, such as extra cards per pack, increased chances of higher-rarity cards, further cooldown reductions, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"38px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Because Noctis Fragmenta is built around its community, owning a Fragmenta also unlocks additional social features. You can combine your Fragmenta with a friend\'s—or even with another Fragmenta you own—to further enhance your pack-opening bonuses. It also grants access to the Trading feature, allowing players to exchange cards and help one another complete their collections.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Disclaimer:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">This is a one-person passion project, and despite my best efforts, I simply don\'t have the artistic talent to create the amount of artwork this project requires.<br><br>For that reason, all artwork—and I really do mean all artwork—has been created using AI.<br><br>If you\'re skeptical about AI-generated art, I completely understand. In fact, I share many of those concerns. However, creating a project of this scale would simply not have been possible for me if I had needed to commission every illustration from the start.<br><br><br>That said, I want to make two promises:<br>- Everything except the artwork is original. The world, story, characters, dialogue, gameplay, code, presentation, and the overall concept have all been created by me without the use of AI.<br>- If—or rather, when—the project gains enough support to fund professional artists, every piece of AI-generated artwork will be replaced with commissioned artwork created by real artists. My goal is for Noctis Fragmenta to eventually become completely AI-free.<br><br>Until then, please think of this as a technology demonstration and proof of concept rather than a finished game.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you for taking the time to try Noctis Fragmenta.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->',	'Info',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'info',	'',	'',	'2026-07-17 06:20:56',	'2026-07-17 06:20:56',	'',	0,	'https://chards.wasmer.app/?page_id=180',	0,	'page',	'',	0),
